          "name": "Amazon EC2 Image Builder List Component Build Versions",
          "request": {
            "name": "Amazon EC2 Image Builder List Component Build Versions",
            "description": {
              "content": "<p>Returns the list of component build versions for the specified semantic version.</p> <note> <p>The semantic version has four nodes: &lt;major&gt;.&lt;minor&gt;.&lt;patch&gt;/&lt;build&gt;. You can assign values for the first three, and can filter on all of them.</p> <p> <b>Filtering:</b> With semantic versioning, you have the flexibility to use wildcards (x) to specify the most recent versions or nodes when selecting the base image or components for your recipe. When you use a wildcard in any node, all nodes to the right of the first wildcard must also be wildcards.</p> </note>",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "ListComponentBuildVersions"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
